    {
      "subId": "4133702",
      "subQuestName": "与孙宇对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413370201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413370201": {
            "id": "413370201",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "在这附近放灯，或许就能被仙人所见吧？但是这材料…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370202"
            ]
          },
          "413370202": {
            "id": "413370202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你在做什么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370203"
            ]
          },
          "413370203": {
            "id": "413370203",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "啊，失礼了，我和师妹正在考虑放霄灯一事。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370204"
            ]
          },
          "413370204": {
            "id": "413370204",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "不过，我们手头这制作霄灯的材料有些不足…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370205"
            ]
          },
          "413370205": {
            "id": "413370205",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "如果这位朋友愿意的话…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370206"
            ]
          },
          "413370206": {
            "id": "413370206",
            "speakerId": 2418,
            "speakerName": "小雀儿",
            "text": "又是古华派，古华派古华派…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370207"
            ]
          },
          "413370207": {
            "id": "413370207",
            "speakerId": 2418,
            "speakerName": "小雀儿",
            "text": "好不容易的一个海灯节，许的愿望还是古华派…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370208"
            ]
          },
          "413370208": {
            "id": "413370208",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "师妹，你我都是古华派门人，振兴古华派，自然是我们的责任。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370209"
            ]
          },
          "413370209": {
            "id": "413370209",
            "speakerId": 2418,
            "speakerName": "小雀儿",
            "text": "是是是，师兄说什么，就是什么…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370210"
            ]
          },
          "413370210": {
            "id": "413370210",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "唉…这位朋友，如果你愿意的话，能麻烦你找一些霄灯的材料给我吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370212",
              "413370214"
            ]
          },
          "413370212": {
            "id": "413370212",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "非常感谢你。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370216"
            ]
          },
          "413370216": {
            "id": "413370216",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "咳，我清点了一下，现在好像还缺了一朵清心…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370217"
            ]
          },
          "413370217": {
            "id": "413370217",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "之前的那些摘了太长时间，变得又干又脆，没法用了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370218"
            ]
          },
          "413370218": {
            "id": "413370218",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "清心也能用来编霄灯吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370219"
            ]
          },
          "413370219": {
            "id": "413370219",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "呵呵，这是之前在古华派里，我和师弟师妹们胡闹的时候想出来的怪法子。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370220"
            ]
          },
          "413370220": {
            "id": "413370220",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "让霄灯带上些花香，倒也有些乐趣。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370221"
            ]
          },
          "413370221": {
            "id": "413370221",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "我就在这里等你，找到材料就请你送回来吧，麻烦你了。"
          },
          "413370214": {
            "id": "413370214",
            "speakerId": 2418,
            "speakerName": "小雀儿",
            "text": "没什么，没什么，师兄说什么就是什么…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370215"
            ]
          },
          "413370215": {
            "id": "413370215",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "唉，师妹…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133703",
      "subQuestName": "将清心交给孙宇",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413370301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413370301": {
            "id": "413370301",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "我就在这里等你，找到材料就请你送回来吧，麻烦你了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133704",
      "subQuestName": "与孙宇对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413370401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413370401": {
            "id": "413370401",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "谢谢你，这样我就能把霄灯编出来了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370402"
            ]
          },
          "413370402": {
            "id": "413370402",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "霄灯编好了，师妹，你待会就把愿望写上去吧，你的字是写得很好的…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370403"
            ]
          },
          "413370403": {
            "id": "413370403",
            "speakerId": 2418,
            "speakerName": "小雀儿",
            "text": "写，我写就是了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370404"
            ]
          },
          "413370404": {
            "id": "413370404",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "师妹…你…是不是有些不高兴？怎么了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370405"
            ]
          },
          "413370405": {
            "id": "413370405",
            "speakerId": 2418,
            "speakerName": "小雀儿",
            "text": "没有，我哪有不高兴，能帮师兄放霄灯，我可高兴了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370408"
            ]
          },
          "413370408": {
            "id": "413370408",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "对，这位朋友说得对，我们该准备去放灯了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370409"
            ]
          },
          "413370409": {
            "id": "413370409",
            "speakerId": 2418,
            "speakerName": "小雀儿",
            "text": "那师兄你自己去吧，我就不去了，爬山太累了…我才没那个劲呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370410"
            ]
          },
          "413370410": {
            "id": "413370410",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "这…我们刚刚才在这里休息了一段时间…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370411"
            ]
          },
          "413370411": {
            "id": "413370411",
            "speakerId": 2418,
            "speakerName": "小雀儿",
            "text": "我头有些痛，不知道是不是方才吹了山风了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370412"
            ]
          },
          "413370412": {
            "id": "413370412",
            "speakerId": 2400,
            "speakerName": "孙宇",
            "text": "这…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133705",
      "subQuestName": "前往古华派故地放飞霄灯",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413370501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413370501": {
            "id": "413370501",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这里应该就是孙宇说的，放霄灯的地方了吧…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133706",
      "subQuestName": "与芷若对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413370601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413370601": {
            "id": "413370601",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "你们是来…放灯的？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370602"
            ]
          },
          "413370602": {
            "id": "413370602",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "只有古华派弟子知道这个放灯的地方，可是我对你们没有什么印象…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370603"
            ]
          },
          "413370603": {
            "id": "413370603",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我是代人来放灯的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370604"
            ]
          },
          "413370604": {
            "id": "413370604",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "还有古华派的人记得这里吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370605"
            ]
          },
          "413370605": {
            "id": "413370605",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "我过来的时候看着这周围寂寥无人，本来有些难过的…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370606"
            ]
          },
          "413370606": {
            "id": "413370606",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "但现在知道还有古华派的人记得这里，心里反倒是好受了不少。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370607"
            ]
          },
          "413370607": {
            "id": "413370607",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "之前古华派会在这里放灯？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370608"
            ]
          },
          "413370608": {
            "id": "413370608",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "嗯…那个时候都是编好霄灯后，师长领着我们过来，师长在前面走，我们捧着霄灯在后面跟着。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370609"
            ]
          },
          "413370609": {
            "id": "413370609",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "那时候…山上山下，霄灯连成一片，可好看了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370610"
            ]
          },
          "413370610": {
            "id": "413370610",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "可是现在…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370611"
            ]
          },
          "413370611": {
            "id": "413370611",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "…我们还是先把灯放起来吧，过去的事，如果不着急，我们可以边走边说。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133712",
      "subQuestName": "(test)放灯表现$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413371201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413371201": {
            "id": "413371201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "霄灯也放了，我们快回去告诉孙宇和小雀儿吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133707",
      "subQuestName": "跟随芷若",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413370701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413370701": {
            "id": "413370701",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "有一次放霄灯的时候，有一位兴致高昂的师兄非要和我比剑。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370702"
            ]
          },
          "413370702": {
            "id": "413370702",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "我还没说话，我的一个好姐妹帮我用水悄悄浇湿了师兄站着的那块地。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370703"
            ]
          },
          "413370703": {
            "id": "413370703",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "那地又湿又滑，师兄还没出剑，刚走了一步就摔了个屁股墩，我笑得不行，也不小心摔倒了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370704"
            ]
          },
          "413370704": {
            "id": "413370704",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "当时那位师兄也没生气，只是指着我笑。然后，周围的大家也笑成了一团…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370705"
            ]
          },
          "413370705": {
            "id": "413370705",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "不知道，这位师兄现在在哪里…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133713",
      "subQuestName": "与芷若对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133708",
      "subQuestName": "跟随芷若",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413370801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413370801": {
            "id": "413370801",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "曾经我也看到过希望，有一位新入古华派的少年，仪表堂堂，天赋异禀，看上去是能重振山门的奇人。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370802"
            ]
          },
          "413370802": {
            "id": "413370802",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "但他踪迹难寻，常常见不到影子，唉，说到底，将振兴门派的愿望寄托于他人，本来就不对吧…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370803"
            ]
          },
          "413370803": {
            "id": "413370803",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "所以，还是由他去，不要期待为好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133714",
      "subQuestName": "与芷若对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4133709",
      "subQuestName": "跟随芷若",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413370901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413370901": {
            "id": "413370901",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "我离开古华派的时候，同门弟子已经寥寥无几了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370902"
            ]
          },
          "413370902": {
            "id": "413370902",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "师父没有责备我，只是叫我要好好生活。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370903"
            ]
          },
          "413370903": {
            "id": "413370903",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "但是，我现在也不知道我是不是真的在好好生活…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370904"
            ]
          },
          "413370904": {
            "id": "413370904",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "又或者，我只不过是在得过且过罢了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370905"
            ]
          },
          "413370905": {
            "id": "413370905",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "我听人说，有一位叫孙宇的古华派门人正在访仙，想要复兴古华派。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370906"
            ]
          },
          "413370906": {
            "id": "413370906",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "我要是有他这种勇气的话…就好了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370907"
            ]
          },
          "413370907": {
            "id": "413370907",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "抱歉，一个人说了这么多，难得到外面来透透气，就是想多说一些话。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370908"
            ]
          },
          "413370908": {
            "id": "413370908",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你好像有点难过。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370909"
            ]
          },
          "413370909": {
            "id": "413370909",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "我、我没事，只不过每年过节的时候，都有点…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370910"
            ]
          },
          "413370910": {
            "id": "413370910",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "好了，时间也差不多了，祝你们海灯节快乐，也麻烦你代我向拜托你放灯的人带句话，就说…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370911"
            ]
          },
          "413370911": {
            "id": "413370911",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "就说…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370912"
            ]
          },
          "413370912": {
            "id": "413370912",
            "speakerId": 2079,
            "speakerName": "芷若",
            "text": "就说…芷若祝他海灯节快乐吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413370913"
            ]
          },
          "413370913": {
            "id": "413370913",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "也祝你海灯节快乐。",
            "nextDialogs": [
